  <item>
    <title>「民航发展史」从707到737｜波音与中国民航从初识到热恋</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680f00727a449ae8581ebf9d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680f00727a449ae8581ebf9d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Apr 2025 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期拿到</span><strong><span>三位老前辈非常珍贵的采访手稿</span></strong><span>，分别是1973年派去学习707的</span><strong><span>阎志祥</span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span>蒋志伟</span></strong><span>，还有1985年去学习737-300飞行的</span><strong><span>杨元元</span></strong><span>。三位前辈都见证了整个中国民航发展的历史，也都经历了波音与中国最蜜月的时段。抛开现在的中美关系不谈，从他们的采访稿不难看出，当年波音对正在起步的中国民航有功不可没的帮助。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>那让我们赶紧坐上飞机，从99号跑道起飞吧！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">2:10</a> 波音之前，民航都在用什么飞机？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">3:10</a> 1972年第一次购买10架707，我们还多买了40个备用引擎？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsYLDkg5dvVwl9O3uEjUgCZ8HCNK.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>6位飞行员去巴基斯坦学习飞行时留下的珍贵照片</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 接707回国的老飞行员蒋志伟回忆对比1973年波音改装和苏联飞机改装：更系统更规范让飞行员更有自信</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtvKJ0lHHhQTZqJjYs_us6IpJ6t5.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>1972年首次赴美改装飞行员、翻译、工程师和波音教员合影</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj9vXPL4elDPUCqGgSjy1H_Q7S4t.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>首架707</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> “中国民航一定要飞出去”：用波音707开拓更多国际的可能性</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjLT3p-3ZX1NJK-O2u9AmzTgM67N.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>1974年英国购买模拟机</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvLQJs-WPbus7RpP_8pPsKU1CDQN.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>中国第一架波音707</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a> 1985年，云南省用4000顿锡换来了2架737-300</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 波音手把手为中国飞行员定制学习教案：从仪表、进离场程序和西方机场设计思路开始学起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1420">23:40</a> 满配五人制飞行仓（工程师、通信员、领航员）降级为飞行员自己搞定每一趟飞行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 波音工程师协助建立珠海培训中心：哪个地方漏雨都要认真记录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> 1991年由两位波音教员租用757拉萨试航，开启多发高高原机场飞行的篇章</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnAAGekN1BJHGULyF9h5srYD3quw.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>演示飞机在拉萨机场起飞</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flx_bpytEhKtp1Baz-RT2Y4kV22Y.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>接受邀请参加拉萨演示飞行人员合影</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a> 在LA机场看达美航空起落来准备中国自己首次「越太平洋延程飞行」广州-洛杉矶</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkamot-27nFb7422IHtHBhixpHgR.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>大字已经印上了，咱一定得成功</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【主理人】Eric&amp;莎莎</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家关注同名</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64c71686000000002b00b763?xsec_token=YBB5tXCHvH_fL-VjmNruPFgBlHHDOe_Sb7ZOYaFn_S86k=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a88d0974eacab4653104c4a&amp;apptime=1734323209&amp;share_id=b731ff57003049518133900b27db9800" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64c71686000000002b00b763?xsec_token=YBB5tXCHvH_fL-VjmNruPFgBlHHDOe_Sb7ZOYaFn_S86k=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a88d0974eacab4653104c4a&amp;apptime=1734323209&amp;share_id=b731ff57003049518133900b27db9800"><span>小红书</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>闲聊播客：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60d88c81abbb931269026ee9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60d88c81abbb931269026ee9"><span>PassionFruits不是百香果</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/661c9edc5dae7932c686454a/lny8GQ5dF8lUHKWRx3Y58LPzq_4U.m4a" length="70177191" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:36:21</itunes:duration>
