  <item>
    <title>VIP Service &amp; 专机｜有钱有权的人都坐什么飞机</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/675fad487d8426f6926ad28f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">675fad487d8426f6926ad28f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 16 Dec 2024 04:50:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期我们聊一聊有钱人和各国首脑都坐什么飞机。这期我们是询问了身边很多知情人士，从专机改装的机务人员，到大老板私人助理，拿到了很多真贵的素材。当然，</span><strong><span>其实还有更多有意思的专机故事我们希望可以分享给大家~如果你们感兴趣记得给我们留言！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>那让我们坐上飞机，从99号跑道起飞吧！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">1:00</a> VIP 我们会分成三大类</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>小飞机（falcon，gulfstreamG650）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>商用飞机（定制，私人老板，空军一号）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>快装式商用飞机（服务与国家首脑政要，如中国的2445，2447，2472）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">3:00</a> 私人飞机价格：感兴趣的大家可以自行查阅购买😄</span><a href="https://www.avbuyer.com/aircraft/private-jets/large" data-url="https://www.avbuyer.com/aircraft/private-jets/large"><span>www.avbuyer.com</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>falcon 900ex （1998） 1000w美金</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft4954iVjpS2q0RBD3M2KOnshOxv.jpeg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>gulfstream G650ER 2018年，4000w美金</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk_QxSDp0u4Wvy97je2l9z16a1dp.jpeg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>737 2014年 5500w美金</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>“明星的私人飞机    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><span>Tom Cruise- gulfsteram GIV 3600w美金</span></li><span>      </span><li><span>Jay Z- Challenger850 4000w美金</span></li><span>      </span><li><span>Jackie chan- embaraer 650 5000w美金</span></li><span>      </span><li><span>Kylie Jenner- bombardier Global 7500 7200w美金</span></li><span>      </span><li><span>Trump 757 1亿</span></li><span>      </span><li><span>Mark Cuban Various 2.8亿</span></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">7:00</a> 内饰装饰</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv-zaT6PR_BovQR4UWuodGXVYg5w.jpeg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>大飞机固定式改装：    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><span>改装工厂有波音旗下自己的工厂，德国汉莎，瑞士jet aviation等</span></li><span>      </span><li><span>737：上图就是一架改装私人737，油管producermichael可以查到更多案例</span></li><span>      </span><li><span>特朗普的757</span></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiT63SX2CU-FUc_tf3SDEm2jk2EM.jpeg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>空军一号747-2（播客里口误，是-2改-8）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj4TQzTINt8aQji7gDyqAmTz81gp.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvzMmetz9zC6d-rKAUDJOyhAcVZv.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>House of Cards剧照，Ironman3里也有类似片段，可参考内饰布局，但真实情况咱不知道了</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 中国首脑的快装式vip飞机-747（2445，2447）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvhgaLS_sUzM0NeK-FTciJWVGWbp.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 大老板私人飞机内饰</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj03qzD9eK7Wsnfg60GJ_6AnY4Lc.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>🤐可靠线人爆料</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>【主理人】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Eric&amp;莎莎</span></p><span></span><p><span>闲聊博客：PassionFruits不是百香果</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家关注同名</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64c71686000000002b00b763?xsec_token=YBB5tXCHvH_fL-VjmNruPFgBlHHDOe_Sb7ZOYaFn_S86k=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a88d0974eacab4653104c4a&amp;apptime=1734323209&amp;share_id=b731ff57003049518133900b27db9800" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64c71686000000002b00b763?xsec_token=YBB5tXCHvH_fL-VjmNruPFgBlHHDOe_Sb7ZOYaFn_S86k=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a88d0974eacab4653104c4a&amp;apptime=1734323209&amp;share_id=b731ff57003049518133900b27db9800"><span>小红书</span></a></p>]]></description>
