  <item>
    <title>转机票便宜？选机型选座位？关于飞机购票背后的故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6670564ac26e396a36773297</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6670564ac26e396a36773297</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Jun 2024 22:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>航空专栏第二期！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期结合了消费者视角和航司视角，说一说我们在购票时的最优解。中国三大航空公司作为“可以不赚钱的”服务行业，其实宠坏了很大一批顾客。商家和消费者的身份永远是流动的，让利是给商家也是给自己。而作为消费的一部分，我们在选购机票的时候，也是去寻找属于自我心目中那份最佳的性价比。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>让我们坐上飞机，从99号跑道起飞吧！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">2:00</a> 购票怎么选飞机？拒绝737和320？</span></p><span></span><p><span>经济舱座位对比：空客330vs空客350vs波音787</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpZXQSaKivB75X66oz_aottjuOp9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>以下为座舱图</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqTRgBlWg5R3c0c-QmI3XYsec0E9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（222大通铺公务舱+121头等舱）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frbr1Wgx3M2RVWUYo79JOhwqR1Uo.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvR1s3mjmoZuKvEhPiJAzprb09Pi.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（222反鱼骨公务舱）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqP1BRh8-qhzMgIj4imnxDnAjlLm.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（121交错公务舱）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoxcqamdLexh207DN-MYVmuF8q2v.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（222大通铺公务舱）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 超级经济舱？！令人难忘的波兰航空</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 3-4-3布局，5.5米空间一排10个人！惨绝人寰啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 空客330 - 法国人最后的浪漫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 春秋航空盈利能力首屈一指：各大航司财报朗读</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 为什么转机更便宜？航空中转站是盈利法宝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 为什么早班和晚上的机票便宜？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主理人】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Eric&amp;莎莎</span></p><span></span><p><span>闲聊播客：PassionFruits</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博小红书抖音如果有就都是</span></p><span></span><p><span>@莎莎Pluss</span></p><span></span><p><span>@楼长Eric</span></p>]]></description>
